    "template": "({ event, belief, consequence, dispute, alt_belief, effect, coach_notes, ctx, audience, style, tone }) => [\n    'Apply the ABCDE cognitive restructuring flow.',\n    ctx && `Context: ${ctx}`,\n    audience && `Audience: ${audience}`,\n    style && `Style: ${style}`,\n    tone && `Tone: ${tone}`,\n    event && ('A — Activating event:\\n' + event),\n    belief && ('B — Belief:\\n' + belief),\n    consequence && ('C — Consequence:\\n' + consequence),\n    dispute && ('D — Dispute:\\n' + dispute),\n    alt_belief && ('Alternative belief:\\n' + alt_belief),\n    effect && ('E — Effect:\\n' + effect),\n    coach_notes && ('Coach/Guide notes:\\n' + coach_notes),\n    'Output:\\n1) Clear chain A→B→C\\n2) Disputed belief with logical alternative\\n3) Healthier effect or outlook\\n\\nChecklist:\\n- [ ] All steps A–E filled\\n- [ ] Dispute grounded in evidence/logic\\n- [ ] Alternative belief stated\\n- [ ] Effect shows reduced distress or constructive behavior'\n  ].filter(Boolean).join('\\n')",
    "meta": {
      "search_text": "abcde — activating event · belief · consequence · dispute · effect abcde-cbt-framework a structured cognitive restructuring tool from rebt/cbt that traces the chain from an activating event → belief → consequence, then challenges the belief (dispute) and envisions a healthier effect. used for self-coaching, journaling, and therapy. fill in each step a–e with concise statements (1–3 sentences). use dispute to logically test the belief. add an alternative belief to reinforce constructive thinking. rate emotions before/after to see the effect. revisit the exercise as beliefs recur. lens:western level:intermediate persona:account-executive persona:advertising-copywriter persona:applied-scientist persona:brand-strategist persona:caregiver persona:content-strategist persona:data-scientist persona:director persona:donor-relations persona:editor persona:filmmaker persona:fundraiser persona:grant-writer persona:journalist persona:mediator persona:parent persona:partner persona:poet persona:product-marketer persona:sales-engineer persona:sales-representative persona:screenwriter persona:scriptwriter persona:solutions-engineer persona:statistician persona:video-producer persona:videographer persona:writer scope:organization scope:self topic:bias topic:future-self type:framework use:presentation use:problem-framing use:recipe use:scope-management mental-health reflection critical-thinking management activating event belief or thought consequence (feelings/behavior) dispute (challenge the belief) alternative belief (optional) effect (new outcome) coach/guide notes (optional)"
    }
