      "Cut anything that doesn’t ease a pain or create a gain.",
      "Category of One formula: I am a recognized role category who specializes in a distinctive problem space using credible methods to create a valuable outcome.",
      "Proof-of-work beats claim-only positioning: attach a small artifact, decision log, synthesis sample, workflow map, or before/after example to the value proposition."
