    "help": "Describe the protected route, then choose K, diversity knobs (temperature, top-p), an agreement rule, an entropy strictness, and abstain/revision/tie-break policies. Every select offers None and Other. Use notes fields to specify numeric thresholds or custom logic. The output block computes scores, explains choices, and produces a final decision.",
