        "ph": "Reliability=2 — anchors: 0 no SLOs; 3 99.9% with postmortems; 5 99.99% + proactive credits\nRetention=2 — anchors: 0 unknown; 3 NRR 105–115%; 5 NRR ≥120% by cohort\nTime to Value=1 — anchors: 0 undefined; 3 median 45 days; 5 median 14 days with playbooks",
