      "Align leadership on which strengths to amplify and which weaknesses to neutralize.",
      "Translate regulatory and market shifts into specific opportunity plays.",
      "Defend against emerging threats with counter-positioning and standards.",
      "Plan capability building and partnerships that unblock opportunities.",
      "Create a one-page TOWS canvas for a product, segment, and region.",
